% Scenario: the mitre limit cuts a sharp corner to a bevel. The path
% turns through about 11 degrees, where the mitre length is some ten
% line widths (PLRM3 §8.2 setmiterlimit): under the default limit of
% 10 the outline (page 1) and the stroke (page 2) show a bevel; under
% a limit of 20 (pages 3 and 4) the mitre spike is drawn.
/path { 120 200 moveto 420 200 lineto 120 260 lineto } def
24 setlinewidth
path strokepath fill
showpage
24 setlinewidth
path stroke
showpage
24 setlinewidth 20 setmiterlimit
path strokepath fill
showpage
24 setlinewidth 20 setmiterlimit
path stroke
showpage
